---
description: Require a fresh feature branch for every Caerus feature or issue
alwaysApply: true
---

# Feature Branch Workflow

- Before changing code for a Caerus feature or issue, fetch the latest remote state.
- Start the work from updated `origin/main` on a new branch named `codex/<short-feature-name>`.
- Never reuse a branch that already has, or previously had, a pull request.
- Confirm the current branch is dedicated to the requested work before editing or committing.
- Keep unrelated working-tree files out of the feature commit.
